{title: Farq Hai}
{artist: Suzonn}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Main Zameen Tu Asmaan,        [E]Aur Adhuri Dastaan
[E]Naate Kaise [B]Judee,        [E]Tu Resham Si Pari
[E]Mujhme Kya Hai Saadgi,        [A]Raaste Mude [B]Huwein
[E]Hum Tum [A]Alag Hai,        [B]Farq Hai [A]Farq Hai [E]Farq Hai
[E]Arz Main Tu [A]Falak Hai,        [B]Farq Hai [A]Farq Hai [E]Farq Hai
[E]Naaz Tu Mujir Me,        [E]Zid Pe Ab Lakeer Hai
[A]Beyhadh Hai [B]Faasle,        [E]Main Shaamat Ka Nishaan
[E]Tujhpe Unko Hai Gumaan,        [A]Duniya Mujhko [B]Sahee
[E]Main Mohtaaj Tu [A]Dhadak Hai,        [B]Farq Hai [A]Farq Hai [E]Farq Hai
[E]Main Berang Tu [A]Chamak Hai,        [E]Farq Hai [A]Farq Hai [B]Farq Hain
